x":null,"text":"把「一次跑完三千公尺」，先改成「不停下來跑完一千公尺」。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把這個月和上個月的長跑時間記下來，看看是否有進步。","n":25,"ssz":"..1.1.1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問教練：「為什麼捕手要做腿部訓練？它在比賽中有什麼用？」","n":28,"ssz":".....1......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把每天重複五十次的基本動作，改成和隊友進行三關挑戰。","n":26,"ssz":"...1............1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎情境演練：\n情境一：\n小琳剛開始學一首新歌，想要一開始就把整首歌完整彈好。幾個難的段落一直彈錯時，她就想：「整首都彈不好，我大概做不到。」","n":70,"ssz":"..................2......2.............1....2............1........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎情境演練：","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"情境一：","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小琳剛開始學一首新歌，想要一開始就把整首歌完整彈好。幾個難的段落一直彈錯時，她就想：「整首都彈不好，我大概做不到。」","n":58,"ssz":"......2......2.............1....2............1........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.她的念頭可能比較接近哪一個？","n":16,"ssz":"..............1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我都提不起勁」","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「為什麼要做這個？」","n":10,"ssz":".1.....1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「太難了，我大概做不到」","n":12,"ssz":".........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「好像都沒有進步」","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.根據她的念頭，哪個方法最值得她先試？","n":20,"ssz":"......