............1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→真實生活不像選擇題，一個人沒動力時，可能同時遇到好幾個問題。看不見進步時，「堅持」不一定只是一直做原來的事情。\n我們還可以：換個方式、找到理由、縮小一步、看見進步。\n不過有些事情，不是換一種方法就會立刻消失。\n受傷後，復健還是需要時間；選拔落選，結果已經發生；努力了很久，也不一定能得到原本期待的結果。","n":152,"ssz":".....1......1..............1....1..........1...2................1..........1........1......1..2............................................1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→真實生活不像選擇題，一個人沒動力時，可能同時遇到好幾個問題。看不見進步時，「堅持」不一定只是一直做原來的事情。","n":56,"ssz":".....1......1..............1....1..........1...2........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們還可以：換個方式、找到理由、縮小一步、看見進步。","n":26,"ssz":".......1..........1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不過有些事情，不是換一種方法就會立刻消失。","n":21,"ssz":"1......1..2.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"受傷後，復健還是需要時間；選拔落選，結果已經發生；努力了很久，也不一定能得到原本期待的結果。","n":46,"ssz":".................................1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎換我試試看：\n想一件最近「我想做好，但最近有點沒動力」的事，回答以下問題：(沒有標準答案)","n":46,"ssz":".............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎換我試試看：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想一件最近「我想做好，但最近有點沒動力」的事，回答以下問題：(沒有標準答案)","n":38,"ssz":"......................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三題都是主觀自評／複選，沒有客觀正解，依 skill 不給 answer。","n":37,"ssz":"....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.最近的我，可能有下面哪些情況？(可複選)","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①做法一直重複，我漸漸失去興趣","n":15,"ssz":"...2.1.......1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②我不太清楚，做這件事對我有什麼意義","n":18,"ssz":"..1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"③失敗幾次後，我開始懷疑自己做不到","n":17,"ssz":"...............1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"④我只看到還沒做好的地方，常常看不見自己的改變","n":23,"ssz":"................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑤我現在其實太累、受傷或壓力太大，需要先休息或找人幫忙","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[5]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑥其他：＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.我想先試哪個方法？（可複選）","n":16,"ssz":".......1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①換個方式：讓原來的事情增加一些變化","n":18,"ssz":"..1...........2..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②找到理由：重新想想，我為什麼想做這件事","n":20,"ssz":"......1.....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"③縮小一步：先訂一個現在比較有機會完成的小目標","n":23,"ssz":"...1.....1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].items[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"④看見改變：留下紀錄，和以前的自己比較","n":19,"ssz":"...........1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].items[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑤先休息或找人幫忙：如果真的太累、受傷或壓力太大，先照顧自己，再決定下一步。","n":38,"ssz":"...................................1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.如果這段辛苦暫時不能消失，我希望走過以後，自己能藉此機會多學會什麼？","n":36,"ssz":"...................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①更了解自己的能力","n":9,"ssz":"..1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②學會調整方法","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"③更能面對失敗","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].items[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"④更懂得照顧自己","n":8,"ssz":"...1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].items[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑤多一些自律、合作或面對挫折的韌性","n":17,"ssz":"..2.............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"結構","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段落","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"內容","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.intro","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本篇文章從常見的訓練困境切入，分別舉出林詩翔和林智勝面對低潮、重新調整的歷程，提出對「堅持」和「看不見成長」時的想法。請根據文章結構整理重點。","n":71,"ssz":"......................1........1..............1..1..1.................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].結構","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"提出困境","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"當自己已經努力很久，卻遲遲看不到想要的成果，「就可能開始，就可能開始（）自己」：是不是沒有天分？努力真的有用嗎？","n":56,"ssz":"..............1..........................1.............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容_sub_questions[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「就可能開始，就可能開始（","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容_sub_questions[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相信","n":2,"ssz":"1."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容_sub_questions[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"懷疑","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容_sub_questions[0].tail","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"）自己」","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].結構","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"舉例說明","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].子題","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"林詩翔","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"serv